# Growers Notebook — Design System & Brand Identity

## What this product is

Growers Notebook is a **cannabis community social media ENGINE** — not a blog, not a SaaS dashboard. Think: Reddit × GrowDiaries × Facebook Messenger, purpose-built for home cannabis growers. Every design decision should ask: "does this feel like a place people want to hang out and grow together?"

---

## Brand

- **Name:** Growers Notebook  
- **Tagline:** Grow · Share · Thrive  
- **Logo:** Notebook with leaf/plant SVG glyph (`SiteLogoMark` component) — green gradient, notebook + leaf icon  
- **Voice:** Warm, direct, grower-to-grower — never corporate or clinical

---

## Color System (CSS variables — ALWAYS use these, never hardcode hex)

### Dark mode (default — site ships dark)
```
--gn-accent:           #4ade80   ← Forest green — primary brand, CTAs, links, active states
--gn-hot:              #f97316   ← Orange — ONLY for fire/hot indicators, NOT general UI
--gn-page-top/mid/bot: #0d1610 → #0a1209 → #070e06  (deep forest dark)
--gn-surface:          #111a12
--gn-surface-raised:   #162118
--gn-surface-elevated: #1b2a1d
--gn-surface-muted:    #0f1810
--gn-text:             #e8f5ea
--gn-text-muted:       #7fa887
```

### Light mode
```
--gn-accent:           #15803d   ← Forest green-700
--gn-page-mid:         #f4f0ea   (warm cream)
--gn-surface:          #ffffff
--gn-text:             #111a14
--gn-text-muted:       #4a6455
```

### Color rules
- **`--gn-accent` (green)** = all primary buttons, active nav, links, vote upvote, badges, focus rings
- **`--gn-hot` / `text-orange-500`** = fire icon, "Hot this week" — ONLY orange allowed on the site
- **`text-violet-600/400`** = vote downvote — no other uses
- **Never** use hardcoded hex colors. Never use `bg-orange-*` except fire icon
- Community icon fallbacks use a 10-color hash palette (emerald, teal, sky, violet, amber, fuchsia, cyan, etc.) — these are baked into `community-icon.tsx`

