## Layout Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  SiteHeader (sticky, h-14, glass blur)                 │
├──────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────┤
│              │                                          │
│  AppSidebar  │  Main content (max-w-5xl centered)      │
│  (w-56       │  + optional right sidebar (w-72)        │
│   sticky)    │                                          │
│              │                                          │
└──────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- Page content: `mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl lg:max-w-[1100px]`
- Feed pages: 70% main + 30% right sidebar at `lg:` breakpoint
- Sidebar: `w-56` fixed, collapsible on mobile via drawer

---

## Component Design Rules

### Cards
- Border radius: `rounded-2xl` for content cards, `rounded-xl` for interactive items, `rounded-full` for pills/badges
- Elevation: `shadow-[var(--gn-shadow-sm)]` default, `shadow-[var(--gn-shadow-md)]` on hover
- Background: `bg-[var(--gn-surface-raised)]` — never solid white or black
- No heavy borders — use shadows for elevation

### Feed Post Cards (Reddit-style)
```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  [Full-width hero image, edge-to-edge]   │
├────┬─────────────────────────────────────┤
│ ▲  │  u/grower · r/community · 3h ago   │
│ 14 │  Post title font-bold              │
│ ▼  │  Excerpt line-clamp-2              │
│    │  [💬 24]  [↗ Share]                │
└────┴─────────────────────────────────────┘
     ↑ Left vote rail: w-12 flex-col
```
- Images always first — GrowDiaries principle
- Vote rail always on the left — Reddit principle
- Community badge overlaid on hero image top-left

### Post Detail Pages (GrowDiaries-style)
- Hero image: `h-80 sm:h-96` — tall, dominant
- Order: Hero → Author strip → Title → Body → Comments
- Comments: avatar + name + time + body, depth-indented with left border lines
- Composer: wrapped in `rounded-2xl bg-[var(--gn-surface-elevated)] p-4` — Facebook-style

### Sidebar Navigation
- Logo: `SiteLogoMark` glyph + "Growers Notebook" wordmark + "Grow · Share · Thrive" tagline
- Nav icons: colored chip `h-7 w-7 rounded-lg` behind each icon (green for home, orange for fire, sky for messages, etc.)
- Community list: colored letter avatars from hash palette (never plain gray)
- User footer: avatar + name + settings icon + sign out

### Messages (Facebook Messenger-style)
- Two-column layout: conversation list left, chat thread right
- Bubbles: sent = right-aligned `bg-[var(--gn-surface-elevated)]` with green left accent border; received = left-aligned `bg-[var(--gn-surface-raised)]`
- Thread rows: avatar (36px circle) + name + preview + timestamp
- Input: `rounded-2xl bg-[var(--gn-surface-elevated)] ring-1 ring-[var(--gn-ring)]`

### Community Pages (Subreddit-style)
- Full-bleed banner (`h-48 sm:h-56`) — real image or gradient fallback
- Community icon overlapping banner bottom edge
- Stats bar: members · posts · created date
- Sticky About sidebar at `lg:` breakpoint
- Sort controls sticky below banner

### Profiles
- Clean header card: avatar (`h-24 w-24`), name, tier badge, stats row
- No background banner (profile isn't a community — keep it clean)
- Pill tab navigation: Posts / Notebooks / Media

### Notebooks (Grow Journal — unique killer feature)
- Phase color pills: Seedling=emerald, Veg=green, Flower=amber, Harvest=orange
- Metric values as rounded pill tags
- Every input field needs: placeholder with example value + helper text explaining optimal ranges
- Week navigation sticky on mobile

